  "scratchpad": "I messaged the analyst in the previous turn to draft the revenue report. No new messages received yet. I should check if the weekly.md file has been updated with a draft, and if not, follow up with the analyst. Need to make progress toward the goal of publishing the report.",
  "actions": [
    {"tool": "read_file", "args": {"path": "reports/weekly.md"}},
    {"tool": "send_message", "args": {"to": "analyst", "content": "Checking in - have you had a chance to query the orders table and draft the revenue report? We need to get this published to the dashboard soon."}}
  ],
  "done": false
}
